        "title": "Robotics - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The \"network\" is physics. Every subsystem has latency, bandwidth, and failure modes —\nthe same layered abstraction discipline you apply to software stacks applies here, just\nthe medium is torque and photons rather than TCP packets."
    },
